2) If semantic lidar returns a centroid for the current target class, planner computes a nav goal offset ≥3.0 m from the centroid toward spawn (0,0): goal = centroid + 3.0*(spawn-centroid)/||spawn-centroid||. Navigator will navigate_to_pose to that goal.
